es-no-app-connections-found":"No app connections found in this Zap","messages-loading-app-connections":"Loading app connections..."},"configurable-templates-consumer-auth-stage-description":{"descriptions-app-connections-purpose":"Connecting your app accounts to Zapier allows you to safely send data to and between your Zap steps. In this step, you\'ll add the <appConnectionsLink>app connections</appConnectionsLink> required for this workflow to run.","headings-how-to-connect-app-accounts":"How to connect your app accounts","descriptions-connect-app-accounts-instructions":"For each app listed, click <selectEmphasis>Select</selectEmphasis>. A dropdown menu will display all app connections that exist in your Zapier account. You can also click <connectNewAccountEmphasis>Connect new account</connectNewAccountEmphasis> to <createNewAppConnectionLink>create a new app connection</createNewAppConnectionLink> instead.","descriptions-duplicate-apps-account-guidance":"If you see an app listed more than once, the template creator expects different accounts to be used for each one. Refer to the help text for more information.","descriptions-gmail-accounts-example":"There are two Gmail apps listed, with the template creator noting that you should use your personal Gmail account for one and your business Gmail account for the other."},"configurable-templates-consumer-fields-blocker-banner":{"messages-mapping-options-blocked":"Some steps have issues and can\'t provide mapping options.","buttons-review-issues":"Review issues"},"configurable-templates-consumer-fields-stage":{"aria-labels-disabled-step-row":"{stepNumber}. {stepTitle}. {disabledFieldsExplanation}","aria-labels-step-row-needs-input":"{stepNumber}. {stepTitle}. Needs your input","descriptions-disabled-locked-fields-explanation":"These fields aren\'t editable because the template creator has filled them in for you. If you do need to change one of these locked values, you can edit them once you\'ve published your Zap, or by exiting this wizard now.","empty-state-add-steps-to-configure-fields":"Add steps to your Zap to configure fields.","empty-state-no-steps-found":"No steps found in this Zap.","headings-stage-container":"Fields","labels-needs-input":"Needs your input","labels-output-fields":"Output fields","labels-required":"required","labels-tools":"Tools","messages-loading-steps":"Loading steps..."},"configurable-templates-consumer-fields-stage-description":{"headings-what-are-steps":"What are steps?","descriptions-steps-and-actions-overview":"<stepsLink>Steps</stepsLink> are the individual <actionsLink>actions</actionsLink> or events your workflow performs, like triggering on a new record or sending data to another app. Each step builds on the last to form a complete automated process.","headings-what-are-fields":"What are fields?","descriptions-fields-input-mapping-overview":"<fieldsLink>Fields</fieldsLink> are the individual input boxes in a step where you add or map data, like a name, email, or custom value. They tell the step exactly what information to use when the workflow runs.","descriptions-field-types-dropdown-and-dynamic-values":"Some fields are a dropdown, where you can select from a pre-defined list of options (e.g. Slack channels). Other fields are more flexible, allowing you to enter text or select a value from a previous step."},"configurable-templates-consumer-getting-started-stage-description":{"headings-how-to-use-guided-templates":"How to use guided templates","descriptions-template-designed-for-easy-setup":"The creator of this template designed it to be easy and accessible, revealing only the information that is needed to set-up this automation.","descriptions-setup-wizard-guides-step-by-step":"The set-up wizard will guide you step-by-step, including app connections, fields, variables, and testing","descriptions-publish-automation-outcome":"By the end, you will have published an automation!"},"configurable-templates-consumer-modal":{"aria-labels-zap-name-field":"Zap Name","buttons-publish-zap":"Publish Zap","buttons-next":"Next"},"configurable-templates-consumer-overview-app-chips-list":{"aria-labels-apps-in-this-zap":"Apps in this Zap"},"configurable-templates-consumer-test-blocked-card":{"messages-blocked-before-testing":"There are issues that need to be resolved before testing","buttons-review-issues":"Review issues"},"configurable-templates-consumer-test-error-card":{"headings-zap-issues-detected":"Issues with your Zap have been detected","options-copilot-heading":"Troubleshoot with Copilot","options-copilot-description":"Exit this template and chat with Copilot in the Editor to address these issues together.","buttons-open-copilot":"Open Copilot","options-manual-heading":"Troubleshoot Manually","options-manual-description":"Exit the template and review the Zap status page to see and resolve errors in this Zap","buttons-view-errors":"View Errors"},"configurable-templates-consumer-test-stage":{"headings-stage-container":"Review your Zap","messages-loading-test-status":"Loading test status..."},"configurable-templates-consumer-test-stage-description":{"headings-what-happens-at-this-stage":"What happens at this stage?","descriptions-reviewed-zap-steps-before-turning-on":"We\'ve reviewed each step of your Zap to make sure everything is set up correctly before you turn it on.","descriptions-troubleshooting-options-for-flagged-issues":"If any issues are flagged at this stage, you\'ll have options to troubleshoot them.","messages-note-zap-runs-automatically-when-triggered":"<noteLabel>Note:</noteLabel> Once published, your Zap will start running automatically when triggered."},"configurable-templates-consumer-test-success-card":{"headings-review-complete":"Review complete","messages-all-steps-reviewed-successfully-ready-to-publish":"All steps reviewed successfully. Your Zap is ready to publish."},"configurable-templates-consumer-tool-auth-card":{"buttons-selected-account":"Selected","descriptions-connect-tool-account":"Connect your {appName} account so this AI step can use this tool.","errors-update-authentication-failed":"Failed to update authentication. Please try again.","labels-change-account":"Change account for {appName}","labels-select-account":"Select account for {appName}","labels-tool-connection":"Tool connection — {appName}"},"configurable-templates-consumer-variable-card":{"placeholders-variable-value":"Enter the value for {variableName}...","labels-variable-value":"Value for {variableName}"},"configurable-templates-consumer-variables-stage":{"headings-stage-container":"Variables","descriptions-enter-variable-values":"Enter the value for each variable below"},"configurable-templates-consumer-variables-stage-description":{"headings-what-are-variables":"What are variables?","descriptions-variables-definition-with-link":"<variablesLink>Variables</variablesLink> define a value to be reused across all your steps in a Zap (e.g. key IDs, names, or URLs).","descriptions-variables-propagate-across-zap-steps":"If the creator of the template provided variables, that means you only have to enter a value once and it will propagate across all the appropriate steps and fields in your Zap.","descriptions-template-may-suggest-variable-values":"The creator of the template may have also already suggested values for some of these variables."},"configurable-templates-creator-auth-stage-description":{"descriptions-app-connections-overview":"Your template user must add their <appConnectionsLink>app connections</appConnectionsLink> so they can safely send data to and between steps. All unique app accounts used in the original Zap will appear here.","descriptions-gmail-account-example":"If one step uses your personal Gmail account and another uses your business Gmail account, the user will have to connect an account to each step.","headings-how-to-set-up-this-step":"How to set up this step","descriptions-step-setup-guidance":"In this step, you will create help text to guide them toward using the appropriate accounts for this workflow. After the user connects their accounts, all <mappedFieldsLink>mapped fields</mappedFieldsLink> in the Zap will automatically update.","captions-tip-label":"Tip:","descriptions-help-text-context-tip":"Use the help text to provide team- or project-specific context for your template user."},"configurable-templates-creator-fields-stage-description":{"headings-setup-fields-for-template":"Setting up fields for your template","descriptions-configured-fields-surfaced-with-additional-fields-link":"The <fieldsLink>fields</fieldsLink> you\'ve set are surfaced here. All other fields are in the \\"See additional fields\\" section.","descriptions-set-field-visibility-and-help-text":"All you have to do is determine each field\'s visibility to the user and any associated help text.","headings-field-designation-options":"Designation options for fields","descriptions-locked-field-designation":"Locked: The value from the original Zap persists and template consumer cannot change it (default).","descriptions-editable-field-designation":"Editable: The value from the original Zap persists but template consumer can replace it with their own value.","messages-fewer-fields-improves-template-adoption":"The less fields the user of the template needs to fill out, the more likely your template is to be adopted and widely used."},"configurable-templates-creator-overview-stage-description":{"descriptions-guided-templates-overview":"Guided templates are pre-filled Zap workflows that you share with other users. Guided templates help other users make customized copies of your workflows for their own use.","descriptions-setup-wizard-guidance":"This setup wizard will guide you through each step of setting up a guided template based on your current Zap, including connecting app accounts and deciding which fields and variables users can configure.","headings-how-to-use-this-step":"How to use this step","descriptions-overview-fields-and-ai-generation":"Use the title, description, and overview fields to explain to users why and how they should use your template. Optionally, click <generateWithAiLink>Generate with AI</generateWithAiLink> to have AI create your template. When you share your template, your template user will see any information you enter in these fields.","descriptions-sharing-options-and-library-storage":"When you\'re done, your guided template will include sharing options and will be stored in your Library.","labels-note":"Note:","warnings-templates-not-synced-after-setup":"Guided templates are not synced to the original Zap after setup. If you change your template, those changes will not be reflected in any Zap workflows previously created from it."},"configurable-templates-creator-review-stage-description":{"descriptions-review-return-to-editor":"If you have not published the original Zap, or if there are issues that would prevent you from publishing it, they will be listed here. Click <reviewLink>Review</reviewLink> to return to the editor to fix them. Your template progress will be saved until you return."},"configurable-templates-creator-variables-stage-description":{"descriptions-variables-overview-with-link":"<variablesLink>Variables</variablesLink> are a way to store reusable values that you can map to other fields in your Zap workflows.","headings-how-to-set-up-this-step":"How to set up this step","descriptions-variable-setup-explanation":"Any variables in your Zap appear here. Each one is a placeholder the template user replaces once during setup; that value then applies everywhere the variable is used in the Zap. Global variables from your original Zap become Zap variables in the template user\'s account.","headings-you-can-also":"You can also:","list-items-create-help-text-for-each-variable":"Create help text for each variable.","list-items-variable-editable-or-locked-description":"Determine whether each variable is editable (the template user can change it) or locked (a fixed value) for the template user."},"configurable-templates-success-stage":{"headings-template-published-success":"Template successfully published!","headings-share-template":"Share template","headings-share-template-name":"Share {templateName}","tabs-workspace":"Workspace {workspaceName}","tabs-organization":"Organization {organizationName}","tabs-general-access":"General access","labels-close-share-dialog":"Close share dialog","buttons-link-copied":"Link copied!","buttons-copy-link":"Copy link"},"configurable-templates-variables-stage":{"messages-deleted-variable-reference-warning":"This variable has been deleted.{referencedIn} Its references must be fixed before you can proceed.","buttons-fix-in-step":"Fix in {stepLabel}","labels-undefined-variable-display":"[Undefined Variable {index}]"},"configurable-templates-variables-stage-content":{"headings-deleted-variables-section":"Deleted variables","headings-provide-variable-guidance":"Provide additional guidance for entering values for your variables","headings-variable-scope":"{scopeName} variables","labels-variable-designation-editable":"Editable","labels-variable-designation-locked":"Locked","labels-variable-requirement":"Requirement for {variableName}","labels-variable-guidance":"Guidance for {variableName}","placeholders-variable-guidance":"Add a note for {variableName}","empty-state-title":"This Zap doesn\'t use variables yet","empty-state-description":"Variables let template users set a value once and reuse it across steps. Add Zap or global variables in the editor if you want them in this template.","loading-state-message":"Loading variables...","variable-stubs-value-set-by-template-user":"Each template user sets this value","labels-variable-value":"Value for {variableName}","placeholders-variable-value":"Enter the value for {variableName}…"},"configurable-templates-workspace-tab":{"labels-add-member-or-team":"Add member or team","descriptions-account-owners-and-super-admins-have-access-by-default":"Account owners and super admins have access by default."},"continue-button":{"aria-labels-waiting-for-data":"Waiting for data to load"},"connected-assets":{"empty-state-content":"Tables and Forms used in this Zap will be displayed here.","empty-state-aria-label":"Connected assets empty state","errors-form-fetch":"There was an issue retrieving information about your form.","errors-table-fetch":"There was an issue retrieving information about your table."},"connected-assets-asset":{"aria-asset-card":"{title} {serviceTooltip}","aria-asset-external-link":"{title} link","labels-service-tooltip-forms":"Forms","labels-service-tooltip-table":"Tables","labels-shared-with-me-tag":"Shared with me"},"connected-assets-asset-avatar":{"captions-owner-attribution":"by {authorFullName}","captions-asset-attribution":"by {avatarName}"},"connected-assets-create-asset-button":{"buttons-create-asset":"Create {assetLabel}","labels-asset-type-form":"Form","labels-asset-type-table":"Table","labels-create-asset":"Create {assetLabel}"},"connected-assets-panel":{"aria-labels-panel-loader":"Connected Assets Panel Loader","descriptions-referenced-assets-list":"All assets referenced in this Zap are listed here.","headings-linked-assets":"Linked assets","labels-connected-assets":"connected assets","labels-embedded-related-systems-list-page":"Embedded Related Systems List Page"},"connected-assets-zero-state":{"headings-no-assets":"No assets","descriptions-tables-and-interfaces-displayed-here":"Tables and Interfaces used on this zap will be displayed here.","labels-empty-state":"Connected assets have no assets"},"copied-step-display":{"aria-labels-dismiss-copied-step":"Dismiss copied step","messages-step-copied-to-clipboard":"Step copied to clipboard"},"copilot-ai-choice-suggestions-results":{"headings-recommended-from-loaded-results":"Recommended from loaded results:"},"copilot-ai-field-suggestions-error":{"messages-generation-failed":"Could not generate suggestions."},"copilot-ai-field-suggestions-results":{"headings-recommended-from-tested-steps":"Recommended from your tested steps:"},"copilot-canvas-status-node":{"buttons-resume-building":"Resume","buttons-make-adjustment":"Make an adjustment","buttons-publish-zap":"Publish","buttons-build-workflow":"Build it","buttons-build-workflow-outline":"Build it","labels-open-copilot-panel":"Open Copilot panel","buttons-suggest-improvements":"Suggest improvements","statuses-stopped-building":"Stopped building","statuses-zap-ready":"Your Zap is ready!","statuses-reasoning":"Reasoning...","statuses-current-tool":"{toolName}...","statuses-can-configure-workflow":"Copilot can fully configure your workflow","statuses-workflow-outline-ready":"Workflow outline ready to build","messages-complete-workflow-setup":"Please help me complete setting up this workflow by configuring authentication and field mappings for any incomplete steps.","messages-fix-workflow-issues":"Please help me fix the issues in this workflow by configuring authentication and field mappings for the incomplete steps.","messages-build-workflow-outline":"Please build and implement this workflow outline now.","messages-build-workflow":"Please help me build this workflow.","messages-review-zap":"Review my Zap and suggest improvements."},"copilot-chat-panel-inner":{"messages-opened-with-suggested-prompt":"Copilot opened with suggested prompt"},"copilot-confirm-plan":{"buttons-build-it":"Build it","labels-tool-display-name":"Confirm Plan"},"copilot-connect-auth-for-step":{"buttons-sign-in-to-app":"Sign in to {appName}","labels-tool-display-name":"Connect Account"},"copilot-edit-draft":{"messages-choose-draft-action":"I need to either edit the current draft or create a new one. What would you prefer?","messages-confirm-edit-zap-and-create-draft":"I need to edit the Zap and create a new draft. Would you like me to proceed?","buttons-edit-zap":"Edit Zap","labels-tool-display-name":"Edit Draft"},"copilot-explain-field-button":{"buttons-explain-field":"Explain field"},"copilot-prompt-node":{"aria-labels-loading-copilot-prompt":"Loading Copilot prompt","labels-or-separator":"or"},"copilot-publish-zap-tool":{"labels-tool-display-name":"Publish Zap"},"copilot-restore-confirmation-modal":{"headings-confirm-revert":"Confirm revert","descriptions-revert-checkpoint-warning":"Are you sure you want to revert to this checkpoint? This will undo all the changes made after this point."},"copilot-select-auth-for-step":{"labels-tool-display-name":"Select Account"},"copilot-selected-auth-state":{"labels-managed":"Managed","labels-select-account":"Select an account"},"copilot-sidebar-icon":{"labels-aria-copilot":"Copilot"},"copilot-support-chat":{"buttons-open-support-chat":"Open Support Chat","labels-tool-display-name":"Checking Support Eligibility"},"copilot-switch-mode":{"buttons-switch-to-suggested-mode":"Switch to {suggestedModeLabel}","labels-tool-display-name":"Switch Copilot Mode"},"copilot-test-zap-step":{"messages-confirmation-required":"The step \\"{stepDescriptor}\\" requires your confirmation to test.","buttons-skip-test":"Skip test","buttons-test-step":"Test step","labels-tool-display-name":"Test step","labels-badge-test":"Test"},"copilot-test-zap-step-output":{"messages-no-output-data":"No output data available.","buttons-toggle-hidden-fields":"{showAll, select, true {Show less} other {{hiddenCount, plural, one {Show # more field} other {Show # more fields}}}}"},"copilot-tool-debug-popup":{"labels-input-args":"Input (args)","labels-output-result":"Output (result)","labels-debug-tool":"Debug {toolName}"},"copy-step-confirmation-modal-content":{"aria-labels-confirm-copy-step":"Please confirm you want to copy this step","labels-do-not-show-again":"Don\'t show this message again","buttons-copy-step":"Copy step"},"default-field-values-initializer":{"messages-applying-default-field-values":"Applying default field values…"},"delete-draft-confirmation-modal":{"headings-delete-draft":"Delete draft?","descriptions-delete-draft-warning":"This draft and all of your updates within the draft will be permanently deleted. You can always create a new draft from a previously published version of the Zap.","buttons-delete-draft":"Delete draft"},"delete-path-step-confirmation-modal":{"headings-confirm-delete-path-step":"Are you sure you would like to delete this?","descriptions-delete-path-step-warning":"Deleting a path step or path branch deletes all the subsequent steps.","aria-buttons-cancel-delete-step":"Cancel delete step","aria-buttons-confirm-delete-step":"Confirm delete step","buttons-delete-step":"Delete step"},"delete-step-confirmation-modal":{"descriptions-broken-data-impact":"This step is using data from the step being deleted. By deleting the step, that data will no longer be available. If you continue, you will need to replace or remove the following data.","descriptions-attention-indicator":"The steps that need your attention will be marked with","aria-buttons-cancel-delete-step":"Cancel delete step","aria-buttons-confirm-delete-step":"Confirm delete step","buttons-delete-step":"Delete step"},"details-panel-code-builder-input-data-promo-alert":{"buttons-explore-features":"Explore features","descriptions-discover-features":"Discover new features to build, run, and manage your code steps.","titles-alert":"Code by Zapier is more powerful"},"details-panel-discover-code-by-zapier-field":{"aria-labels-help-link-in-new-tab":"{topic} in a new tab","descriptions-intro-paragraph-one":"Shape your automation with the precision of code.","descriptions-intro-paragraph-two":"Build complex workflows, orchestrate multiple actions, and work across apps with just one code step.","messages-list-item-packages":"Use third-party packages (npm & PyPi) to extend your capabilities","messages-list-item-runtimes":"Run longer jobs (up to 10 minutes) for real processing","messages-list-item-sdk":"Call any app or API via the Zapier SDK, using your existing authenticated connections"},"details-panel-edit-custom-action-button":{"buttons-edit-custom-action":"Edit Custom Action","labels-edit-custom-action":"Edit Custom Action"},"details-panel-empty-step-details":{"headings-step-details":"Step Details","descriptions-select-step-to-configure":"Click on a step to view or edit the configuration."},"details-panel-field-value-display":{"aria-labels-hide-password":"Hide password","aria-labels-show-password":"Show password"},"details-panel-focus-mode-button":{"buttons-prompt-assistant":"Prompt assistant","buttons-open-step-details-focus-mode":"Open step details in focus mode","tooltips-open-prompt-builder":"Open prompt builder","labels-close-step-details-focus-mode":"Close step details focus mode"},"details-panel-focus-mode-navigation":{"buttons-next-step-with-number":"Next: Step {nextStepNumber}","buttons-next-step":"Next step","labels-previous-step":"Previous step","labels-next-step":"Next step"},"details-panel-runtime-settings-field":{"aria-labels-learn-how-tasks-counted-new-tab":"Learn how tasks are counted in a new tab"},"details-panel-form-builder-controller":{"labels-forms-icon":"Forms"},"details-panel-published-step-app-and-event-display":{"labels-app":"App","labels-event":"Event","badges-deprecated":"Deprecated","badges-legacy":"Legacy"},"discard-unpublished-zap-modal":{"headings-discard-unpublished-zap":"Discard unpublished Zap?","descriptions-save-unpublished-draft":"Save your draft to keep your changes, or discard them to leave without saving.","buttons-save-draft":"Save draft","buttons-discard-draft":"Discard draft","aria-buttons-continue-editing":"Continue editing"},"edit-draft-confirmation-modal":{"headings-resume-editing-your-zap":"Resume editing your Zap","descriptions-edit-or-create-draft":"Would you like to edit the existing draft or create a new draft?","buttons-edit-existing-draft-busy-in-progress":"Opening draft…"},"edit-draft-confirmation-modal-with-zap-diff":{"headings-resume-editing-your-zap":"Resume editing your Zap","descriptions-edit-or-create-draft":"Would you like to edit the existing draft or create a n